    <description>This Screen Flow is used within the Product Management Tool (PMT) to assign a Third Party and its corresponding role to a PMT project.
The association is initially made at the project level only. Once the project reaches Go Live, the Third Party record will be linked to the corresponding product code via a batch process that transfers data from PMT to the Product Catalog.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
